#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<iswspace> function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
#| "B<isspace> function. It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character belonging "
#| "to the wide character class \"space\"."
msgid ""
"The B<iswspace>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<isspace>(3)  function.  It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"space\"."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswspace> é a equivalente para caracteres largos da função "
"B<isspace>. Ela testa se I<wc> é um caractere largo pertencente à classe "
"'space'."

#.  Note: UNIX98 (susv2/xbd/locale.html) says that "space" and "graph" may
#.  have characters in common, except U+0020. But C99 (ISO/IEC 9899:1999
#.  section 7.25.2.1.10) says that "space" and "graph" are disjoint.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"space\" is disjoint from the wide character "
#| "class \"graph\" and therefore also disjoint from its subclasses "
#| "\"alnum\", \"alpha\", \"upper\", \"lower\", \"digit\", \"xdigit\", "
#| "\"punct\"."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"space\" is disjoint from the wide-character class "
"\"graph\" and therefore also disjoint from its subclasses \"alnum\", "
"\"alpha\", \"upper\", \"lower\", \"digit\", \"xdigit\", \"punct\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe 'space' é disjunta da classe 'graph', e portanto, também disjunta "
"das suas subclasses 'alnum', 'alpha', 'upper', 'lower', 'digit', 'xdigit' e "
"'punct'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"space\" contains the wide character class "
#| "\"blank\"."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"space\" contains the wide-character class "
"\"blank\"."
msgstr "A classe 'space' contém a classe 'blank'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The wide character class \"space\" always contains at least the space "
#| "character and the control characters '\\ef', '\\en', '\\er', '\\et', "
#| "'\\ev'."
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"space\" always contains at least the space "
"character and the control characters \\[aq]\\[rs]f\\[aq], "
"\\[aq]\\[rs]n\\[aq], \\[aq]\\[rs]r\\[aq], \\[aq]\\[rs]t\\[aq], and "
"\\[aq]\\[rs]v\\[aq]."
msgstr ""
"A classe 'space' sempre contém pelo menos o caractere espaço e oscaracteres "
"de controle '\\ef', '\\en', '\\er', '\\et' e '\\ev'."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
