#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<iswspace> function returns non-zero if I<wc> is a wide character "
#| "belonging to the wide character class \"space\". Otherwise it returns "
#| "zero."
msgid ""
"The B<iswspace>()  function returns nonzero if I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"space\".  Otherwise, it returns zero."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswspace> retorna um valor diferente de zero se I<wc> é um "
"caractere largo pertencente à classe 'space'. Caso contrário ela retorna 0."

